    "pptx_chart_ex_boundary": "The native ChartEx XML and embedded workbooks are package-readable. The typed ChartEx reader accepts the sunburst data graph and embedded workbook, but its current subtotal codec does not accept PowerPoint's attribute-form subtotal indices in the waterfall part.",
